# Inventory
# Copied from Nostalgic Tweaks' own access widener (common/src/main/resources/nostalgic_tweaks.accesswidener,
# LGPL-3.0-only; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md), under its own "# Inventory" heading and with its two declarations
# unchanged. A slot's screen coordinates are final in 1.21.1, and moving a slot is how upstream hides the off-hand
# slot in a version that had none (SlotTracker.move writes `slot.x = x; slot.y = y;`). Lifting the finality here is
# what lets that code be the same code, rather than an accessor of this project's own.
mutable field net/minecraft/world/inventory/Slot x I
mutable field net/minecraft/world/inventory/Slot y I
